<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108133" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπο-βλητέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be put under,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ φυτῷ ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					19.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβλητέον</span>
			<i>one must put under,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίθῳ ἄμμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					6.2.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.46
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				7.26
			</span></i>; <i>one must cause to lie</i> in the bath, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.37.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must lay the foundation of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					7.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
